        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Mount & Blade II: Bannerlord is the eagerly awaited sequel to the acclaimed medieval combat simulator and role-playing game Mount & Blade: Warband. Set 200 years before, it expands both the detailed fighting system and the world of Calradia. Bombard mountain fastnesses with siege engines, establish secret criminal empires in the back alleys of cities, or charge into the thick of chaotic battles in your quest for power.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Mount & Blade II: Bannerlord es la esperada secuela del aclamado simulador de combate medieval y juego de rol Mount & Blade: Warband. Ambientado 200 años antes, amplía tanto el detallado sistema de combate como el mundo de Calradia. Bombardea las fortalezas de las montañas con máquinas de asedio, establece imperios criminales secretos en los callejones de las ciudades o carga en medio de batallas caóticas en tu búsqueda de poder.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2020",
          "source": "igdb",
